-- --- Institutions (16) ------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- The PDF's fully-verified set. CHED RO VII counts 139 HEIs across Cebu (111) and Bohol (28);
-- these 16 are the ones cross-validated against CHED directories, institutional
-- prospectuses and PRC registers. The other 123 are absent rather than guessed at.
--
-- The list spans all three sectors the region actually has, which matters because the tier an
-- institution sits in changes who can realistically attend it: state universities (CTU, UP
-- Cebu, CNU, BISU, PhilSCA), private universities and colleges (USC, USJ-R, UC, CIT-U, CDU,
-- Velez, Benedicto, HNU, UB, BIT), and the LUC tier funded by a city ordinance
-- (Lapu-Lapu City College).
--
-- `map_link` is a Google Maps *search* URL built from the institution's name and city — an
-- honest "find this place" link. It is deliberately not a `/maps/place/…` pin, because a pin
-- encodes a surveyed coordinate this seed does not have and inventing one would be fabricating
-- a fact rather than seeding one.

